+# Planted inventory
+
+This repository is a smoke target for appsec-review. Everything below is deliberate. The
+evaluation answer key lives in the separate `appsec-review-smoke-guide` repository; this file
+describes the target, it is not the key.
+
+Line numbers refer to the tagged head. The fixture file `src/synthetic.cpp` is byte-identical to
+`tests/fixtures/graph/codeql_export/synthetic/source/synthetic.cpp` in appsec-review, so the line
+numbers its `expected-facts.json` cites are unchanged.
+
