+| TP-C2 | CWE-22 path traversal | `src/request.cpp` `serve_file` | `recv` to `fopen` via `GET` |
+| TP-C3 | CWE-134 format string | `src/request.cpp` `log_message` | `recv` to `printf(fmt)` via `LOG` |
